BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ceremony for Community Healing
DTSTART:20260826T160000
DTEND:20260826T180000
DTSTAMP:20260825T114929Z
UID:e1e64279ae44ae4fdfeb0dd5f1c3a7@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Ceremony for community healing with VTRC. Rain or shine\, free
  admission. Please RSVP by August 12th. The Vermont Truth and Reconciliati
 on Commission (VTRC) has listened to many truths throughout the breadth of
  the state. Many tears were shed and profound moments took place. We are s
 o honored to have heard Vermonters\, and we would like to host\, in return
  for that vulnerability\, a ceremony for community healing. The VTRC colle
 cted tissues throughout its public and private truth telling events\, and 
 those tears will be given as an offering of healing. This ceremony was a g
 ift from care director of the Canadian TRC\, Brenda Reynolds. Please join 
 us for this public event\, as we offer a space for healing past and presen
 t harm.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Button Bay State Park\, 5 Button Bay State Park Rd
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/ceremony-f
 or-community-healing-07-07-2026-14-19-51
END:VEVENT
