BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Inquisitive Readers Book Club
DTSTART:20260827T180000
DTEND:20260827T190000
DTSTAMP:20260825T114929Z
UID:fa511bc8c6da5a2bae03eb59769b55@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Inquisitive Readers Book Club is a space for curious minds to 
 explore stories\, share perspectives\, and enjoy the kind of conversations
  that stay with you long after the last page. Each month features a title 
 suggested from the group—fiction\, nonfiction\, or anything in between
 —and discussion follows on what moved us\, surprised us\, or made us thi
 nk differently. Whether you’re an avid reader\, just getting back into b
 ooks\, or didn't have time to read the whole thing\, you’re welcome here
 . The August book selection is Three Bags Full by Leonie Swann. For more i
 nformation\, contact Megan Robinson at mrobinson@stjathenaeum.org or 802-7
 48-8291. This event is free\, ADA accessible\, and open to the public.\n\n
 Sources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:St. Johnsbury Athenaeum\, 1171 Main St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/inquisitiv
 e-readers-book-club-21-07-2026-13-41-39
END:VEVENT
